{"resourceIdentifier":"4892","resourceName":"Trees For Livelihoods: Agroforestry In Sonbhadra, Uttar Pradesh, India","description":"The proposed project aims at increasing the tree cover outside forest (ToF) areas through ARR activities. The planting activities occur on predominantly privately owned agricultural lands and consist of planting farmer-friendly trees on the bunds of and within these plots. In some cases, planting occurs on community lands and other non-forest & non-agricultural private lands, that are used by physical structures such as schools and ashrams. Implemented in the Indian state of Uttar Pradesh, overall the project addresses livelihoods, the financial security of local farming and other communities through planting of farmer friendly trees in the project area along with associated community-based interventions.","location":{"latitude":28.207608,"longitude":79.826655},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-01-05","endExclusive":"2024-02-05","endInclusive":"2024-02-04"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4892"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Uttar Pradesh"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"21675"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5000 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"EcoLance Private Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","value